{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux经进程参数直连Kubelet。对应需求：安全检测。官方：Potential Direct Kubelet Access via Process Arguments。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux经进程参数直连Kubelet","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux经进程参数直连Kubelet\n\n### 为何重要\n可能表示异常活动\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://heilancoos.github.io/research/2025/12/16/kubernetes.html#kubelet-api","https://www.cyberark.com/resources/threat-research-blog/using-kubelet-client-to-attack-the-kubernetes-cluster","https://www.aquasec.com/blog/kubernetes-exposed-exploiting-the-kubelet-api/"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"6aa52f86-18f1-4a5a-a0ac-e2b5db8af589","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 安全检测","来源: 默认","对应需求: 安全检测"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"executed\") and\n(\n  /* direct utility execution */\n  process.name like (\"curl\", \"wget\", \"python*\", \"perl*\", \"php*\", \"node*\", \"java\", \"ruby*\", \"lua*\", \".*\") or\n  \n  process.executable like (\"/tmp/*\", \"/var/tmp/*\", \"/dev/shm/*\", \"/var/run/*\", \"/home/*\", \"/run/user/*\", \"/busybox/*\")\n) and\nprocess.args like (\"http*:10250/*\", \"http*:10255/*\", \"wss:*:10250/*\", \"wss:*:10255/*\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1613","name":"Container and Resource Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1613/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
